%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#ef4444', 'edgeLabelBackground': '#fef2f2'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as 🚀 App
    participant Audit as 📝 AuditService
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant Verify as ✅ VerifyChain

    App->>Audit: log({eventType: 'oportunidad.actualizada', ...})
    Audit->>DB: SELECT currentHash FROM audit_log WHERE tenantId=? ORDER BY timestamp DESC LIMIT 1
    DB-->>Audit: previousHash = "a1b2c3..."
    Audit->>Audit: currentHash = SHA256(JSON.stringify({...event, previousHash}))
    Audit->>DB: INSERT audit_log {..., previousHash, currentHash}
    
    %% Later: Verification
    Auditor->>Verify: verifyChain(tenantId, startDate, endDate)
    Verify->>DB: SELECT * FROM audit_log WHERE tenantId=? ORDER BY timestamp
    DB-->>Verify: [entry1, entry2, entry3...]
    loop For each entry
        Verify->>Verify: expected = SHA256({...entry, previousHash})
        Verify->>Verify: assert entry.currentHash === expected
        Verify->>Verify: assert entry.previousHash === previousHash
        Verify->>Verify: previousHash = entry.currentHash
    end
    alt Chain valid
        Verify-->>Auditor: {valid: true}
    else Chain broken
        Verify-->>Auditor: {valid: false, brokenAt: [{id, expected, actual}]}
    end